      "text": "Journey to the West, Chapter 99, Squire Koo's Vow"
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "start": 12.0,
      "end": 15.0,
      "text": "The monster yelled from inside the cave"
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "start": 15.0,
      "end": 20.0,
      "text": "We ate the Tang Muck, so your might is well-leaved"
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "start": 20.0,
      "end": 23.0,
      "text": "Oh no!"
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "start": 23.0,
      "end": 26.0,
      "text": "Bajay fell to his knees and cried"
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "start": 27.0,
      "end": 30.0,
      "text": "Wuching wiped tears from his eyes"
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
